Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.81,0:00:05.56,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,I took one look... and I couldn't speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:18.66,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,Polished, she was so beautiful \Nit was as if she'd been reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:24.44,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,Her melancholy eyes sparkled like stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.22,0:00:30.65,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,So beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:36.96,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Stop running from reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.29,0:00:40.73,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie refused your proposal, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:43.74,Flashback,Marie,0,0,0,,I... I can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.37,0:00:49.29,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Don't thrust reality at me, Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.29,0:00:51.84,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You're always, always so cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.84,0:00:54.18,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,This is my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.18,0:00:58.36,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Still, who would have imagined that you'd mistakenly propose to the wrong sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.13,0:01:01.38,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Well, how could I have known?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.31,0:01:04.96,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,That night, it was Marie's birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.38,0:01:08.71,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,The girl sitting alone in the darkness...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.06,0:01:12.71,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Who would think that she \Nwas the star of the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.09,0:02:49.36,Narration Top,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,My father, Duke Alfred \NGranado, had two wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:49.14,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,559)\pos(472,321)\c&HE7E7D8&\3c&H2A1300&\4c&H5D351B&}Episode 2 "Marie, I Want to Marry You"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:53.35,Flashback,young Mio,0,0,0,,If the cat lay around like \Ntrash, it became trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:56.49,Flashback,young Mio,0,0,0,,If the trash cried, "meow," \Nthen it became a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.49,0:02:58.08,Flashback,young Mio,0,0,0,,And then, with me, it—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:02:58.54,Flashback Top,Laura,0,0,0,,Stop playing games!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.60,0:03:03.86,Flashback,Laura,0,0,0,,Don't you understand your position here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.86,0:03:05.89,Flashback,Laura,0,0,0,,Know your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.12,0:03:13.08,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,The daughter of a noble family equal to the \Nduke's, my father Alfred's official wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:14.38,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,Lady Laura.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.85,0:03:23.89,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,And an Ipsandrian traveling performer \Nhe took as his concubine,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:26.38,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,my mother, Liu Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:52.12,Flashback,Laura,0,0,0,,I thought I heard a commotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.83,0:03:55.18,Flashback,Laura,0,0,0,,Here. Eat this and be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:02.33,Flashback,Laura,0,0,0,,That's something I baked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:05.30,Flashback,Laura,0,0,0,,You're quite trusting to eat it, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.30,0:04:08.35,Flashback,young Kyros,0,0,0,,That's because it's really yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:09.43,Flashback,young Kyros,0,0,0,,I love it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:15.19,Flashback,Laura,0,0,0,,Do you? And what else do you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.52,0:04:21.08,Flashback,young Kyros,0,0,0,,Let's see. Cake and cream \Npuffs and chocolate cookies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.08,0:04:22.69,Flashback,young Kyros,0,0,0,,I love sweets!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:24.98,Flashback,Laura,0,0,0,,I like sweets, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:29.58,Flashback,Laura,0,0,0,,When I make sweets, I don't have \Nto think about unpleasant things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:39.79,Flashback,Laura,0,0,0,,Next time, I'll make some \Nchocolate cookies for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:42.41,Flashback,young Kyros,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.36,0:04:51.61,Flashback,Alfred,0,0,0,,It is true that Laura is my official wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.09,0:04:55.34,Flashback,Alfred,0,0,0,,but all the children she has \Nborne me have been girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:58.93,Flashback,Alfred,0,0,0,,Which is why the one to \Ninherit my dukedom...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:02.19,Flashback,Alfred,0,0,0,,will be Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.95,0:05:20.02,Flashback,Laura's daughter A,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:30.23,Flashback,Laura's daughter B,0,0,0,,Open your eyes! Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.18,0:05:35.16,Flashback,Laura's daughter C,0,0,0,,Why? Why would you take poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.37,0:05:39.01,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,Why had the woman who had \Nbeen so kind to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:42.54,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,chosen death of her own free will?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.85,0:05:51.82,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,After Liu Liu was elevated to \Nthe position of official wife,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:56.38,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,she said that she was no more than a \Nconcubine and left the duke, taking me with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:06:00.87,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,And I, in order to survive in this land,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.87,0:06:03.74,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,attained the status of count \Nthrough my own efforts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:09.89,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,But I hate gatherings of high society,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:14.13,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,and I evaded any talk of \Nmarriage to noble daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.02,0:06:25.07,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Hey there, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.15,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,So you've finally shown your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.09,0:06:33.62,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,If you invite me, then I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:38.18,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Did you receive one as well?\NAn invitation from a rural baron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.18,0:06:39.91,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,Luiphon, you got one, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:45.14,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,It seems that they must have sent one to every \Nbachelor who is wealthy or from the great houses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.66,0:06:50.80,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Baron Shaderan's family's troubles with \Nmoney are well-known among the aristocracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.05,0:06:56.48,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,It's blatantly clear that this birthday \Nparty is a pretext for marketing his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.87,0:06:59.22,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,Honestly. It's despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.68,0:07:03.56,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,But according to rumors, \Nshe is quite the beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.56,0:07:06.07,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I have a fiancée, so I \Ncouldn't possibly go,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.47,0:07:08.33,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,but Kyros, why don't you attend?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.33,0:07:09.58,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,Not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.30,0:07:13.12,Flashback,woman A,0,0,0,,Count Granado?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.07,0:07:16.82,Flashback,woman A,0,0,0,,You're welcome to these if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.27,0:07:22.82,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.97,0:07:35.94,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,The ladies do like you, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:39.74,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,They like me? All they see \Nis my title and my money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.74,0:07:42.93,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,Deep down, those women \Nall despise my heritage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.31,0:07:48.91,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Well, the average noble daughter detests \NIpsandros as a land of barbarians, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.40,0:07:51.14,Flashback,ladies,0,0,0,,He's so wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:52.88,Flashback,ladies,0,0,0,,But the color of his skin...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:54.17,Flashback,ladies,0,0,0,,You know about his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:07:59.84,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.84,0:08:03.06,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,but you can't remain a bachelor forever, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:07.93,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,You are a count and the \Nonly son of a ducal house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.93,0:08:11.41,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,If you stay single, there won't be \Nanyone to carry on the duke's line.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.41,0:08:12.79,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:20.16,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,What sort of lady will be \Nable to win your heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.16,0:08:22.42,Flashback,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I greatly look forward to finding out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:25.91,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,As if such a day would ever come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.14,0:08:34.38,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,No, he's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:38.83,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,The daughter of an impoverished \Nbaron might be just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.03,0:08:43.06,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,And if it's only to be a \Nmarriage of convenience,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:44.82,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,then someone easy to manage would be best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.90,0:08:51.97,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,Love...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.42,0:08:55.22,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,That's something I never need to feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.55,0:09:04.08,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,At least, that's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.83,0:09:09.34,Flashback,Marie,0,0,0,,Personally, I love stories from Ipsandros.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.13,0:09:12.60,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,And yet, I've fallen in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.09,0:09:18.12,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,I wanted to speak with her more,\Nbut she slipped through my fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:27.81,Flashback,nobleman,0,0,0,,By the way, I was wondering if this year—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.81,0:09:30.15,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,Apologies. Are you Baron Shaderan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.15,0:09:31.63,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,Where is your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:34.54,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,The star of the night is right over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:38.37,Flashback,Gregor,0,0,0,,Please! Take our daughter as your bride!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:40.97,Flashback,Elvira,0,0,0,,Oh, my dear! You've had too much to drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.97,0:09:42.09,Flashback Top,Gregor; background,0,0,0,,No, I haven't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.55,0:09:43.49,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,I was told that the House of Shaderan
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.49,0:09:46.62,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,has the elder daughter Anastasia \Nand the younger Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:49.24,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,"The star of the night"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:51.82,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,If she's Marie, the younger \Nsister whose birthday it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:54.82,Italics,Kyros; internal,0,0,0,,then the one I met was the \Nolder sister, Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.45,0:09:59.79,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,I searched for her everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.19,0:10:12.42,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,But no matter how hard I looked...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:18.73,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,I couldn't find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.13,0:10:23.59,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,I decided to send a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.59,0:10:25.35,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,I wanted not the younger sister Marie,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.35,0:10:28.17,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,but the older sister Anastasia as my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.93,0:10:31.39,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,Excellent! A reply has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:34.07,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,After that, I became incredibly busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.07,0:10:36.49,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,To offer my fiancée the finest hospitality,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:39.85,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,I arranged for dresses, \Njewels, and new servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.86,0:10:45.12,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\fnArial\shad0\fs16\pos(474,10)\bord0\c&H37221B&}Anastasia \NIs\N Life
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.61,0:10:44.75,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,I even acquired a body pillow to \Nhold through my sleepless nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.20,0:10:52.37,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.47,0:11:09.29,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,The carriage... fell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.27,0:11:17.07,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,And then, amid my heartbreak and despair...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.43,0:11:21.83,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,the woman I'd thought bore \Nthe name Anastasia arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.38,0:11:24.12,Narration,Kyros; narration,0,0,0,,Marie Shaderan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.90,0:11:29.25,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Honestly, Master, you are such a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:31.20,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Though, my own knowledge\Nwas lacking as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.26,0:11:36.45,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,And now... I've been rejected?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.93,0:11:40.73,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Accepting the truth as truth \Nis a wonderful thing, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.73,0:11:44.72,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Mio, couldn't you be a little \Nless... direct about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.72,0:11:47.83,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Well then, Master, can you explain this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.83,0:11:50.57,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,You turned away and silently\Nshunned Lady Marie's new look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.34,0:11:56.22,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Also, saying, "Send Marie \NShaderan away" wasn't optimal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.49,0:12:01.97,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Master, I am certain that Lady \NMarie believes that you hate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.97,0:12:06.59,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If I clear up that misunderstanding, do you \Nthink she will happily become my wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.59,0:12:07.83,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.25,0:12:11.30,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,But for now, just give it your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:15.08,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,After all, Master, you are the one \Nwho feels a one-sided love here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:17.40,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:20.54,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Let's go and see Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.12,0:12:23.47,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What I want to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:26.16,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,is her smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.60,0:12:32.86,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Worn out, tattered clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:35.60,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,My well-thumbed, beloved book.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:41.56,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,That is all that this world has \Nbestowed upon me, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:48.40,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes? Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.59,0:12:57.12,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Mio... and Lord Kyros?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:13:01.29,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I am so sorry for the \Nrudeness I displayed earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.55,0:13:05.25,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Rudeness? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.25,0:13:08.80,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It was all so sudden that I lost \Nmy composure. I am truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:11.72,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,No, I'm the one who should apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:13.01,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Please lift your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.04,0:13:29.40,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I-It seems that a huge \Nmisunderstanding lies between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.41,0:13:33.92,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,First of all, I don't hate you, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.39,0:13:39.18,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Second, I had thought that you'd come \Nto this palace of your own free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.92,0:13:42.08,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for making such an assumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.50,0:13:45.59,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I truly do want to welcome you as my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.59,0:13:48.05,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Of course. Thank you for having me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.05,0:13:49.01,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.01,0:13:49.72,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:56.21,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wh-When I said that I couldn't be betrothed to \Nyou, it was only because I was so shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.21,0:13:57.93,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.24,0:14:01.60,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes. I have no intention of refusing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.60,0:14:05.74,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I have a general understanding of \Nyour situation, your lordship.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.27,0:14:11.25,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,To inherit the title of duke, you \Nmust marry a woman of noble birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.25,0:14:14.25,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,However, finding a bride has been difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.25,0:14:16.64,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What you're saying is true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:21.75,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,If it weren't, then someone of your standing, \Nsir, would never attend a poor baron's party.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.33,0:14:27.50,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,There, as your potential partner in a \Nmarriage of convenience, you fell for my sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:31.06,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,the beautiful Anastasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:37.61,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I shouldn't have said all that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:39.08,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm so terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:42.49,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Due to the accident, I, the useless \Nyounger sister, have come to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:44.54,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,but I assure you, I know my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.04,0:14:49.82,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Your Lordship, please treat me in \Nwhatever manner serves you best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.82,0:14:52.18,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Wait! Please, just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.18,0:14:55.74,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It's true that I had a political marriage \Nin mind when I went to that party.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.06,0:14:59.02,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,But that night, my feelings changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:01.92,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,That letter was no facade. \NI meant every word!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.35,0:15:07.62,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, I know. Your feelings for Anastasia \Nwere conveyed quite clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.62,0:15:09.79,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,No! That's where you have it wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:12.44,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:20.80,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Both of you, it is time for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:23.43,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I believe it would be best if you \Ncontinued your discussion as you eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:23.56,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(187,1)\fs12\shad0\b1\c&H79ECE0&\3c&H78A2A0&\frz20.42\pos(461,202)}GROWWWWL
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.56,0:15:23.69,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\b1\c&H79ECE0&\3c&H78A2A0&\pos(452,167)\frz11.65}GROWWWWL
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.69,0:15:23.81,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\b1\c&H79ECE0&\3c&H78A2A0&\frz0.6602\pos(473,119)}GROWWWWL
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.81,0:15:23.94,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\b1\c&H79ECE0&\3c&H78A2A0&\frz17.64\pos(455,66)}GROWWWWL
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:24.06,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\b1\c&H79ECE0&\3c&H78A2A0&\frz0.6602\pos(458,47)}GROWWWWL
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.06,0:15:24.19,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\b1\c&H79ECE0&\3c&H78A2A0&\frz8.953\pos(443,36)}GROWWWWL
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.19,0:15:24.31,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\b1\c&H79ECE0&\3c&H78A2A0&\frz0.6602\pos(439,26)}GROWWWWL
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.31,0:15:24.44,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\b1\c&H79ECE0&\3c&H78A2A0&\frz0.6602\pos(434,19)}GROWWWWL
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.44,0:15:25.19,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\b1\c&H79ECE0&\3c&H78A2A0&\frz16.74\pos(420,17)}GROWWWWL
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.83,0:15:30.89,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right. I'm so hungry \NI feel like I'm about to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.11,0:15:41.01,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Everything is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.01,0:15:43.04,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,This is incomparably better than our meals!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:47.04,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.47,0:15:49.82,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,This will be no marriage of convenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:53.47,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,The proposal letter that \NI sent to Anastasia...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.47,0:15:58.01,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I simply got her name confused with yours, \Nthe lady I met in the garden that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.49,0:16:01.42,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,The one I want to marry is you, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.14,0:16:04.48,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:06.06,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You don't believe me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.49,0:16:09.30,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros, you are a kind person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.30,0:16:11.65,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,There's no need to be so \Ncareful of my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.65,0:16:14.28,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I {\i1}knew{\i0} you didn't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.29,0:16:18.97,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,For anyone born into  \Nnobility, marriage is a duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.97,0:16:21.15,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It's the same for Lord Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.15,0:16:24.17,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,No, his responsibilities and \Nmine can't be compared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.02,0:16:27.74,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I'm certain that he'll take a concubine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.74,0:16:30.91,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I may end up wearing tattered \Nclothes and working again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.28,0:16:36.06,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,But I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.06,0:16:38.62,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Life will be much the same\Nas it always has been.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:41.98,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Um, is there anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:47.83,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I love you, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.12,0:16:52.62,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Love?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.62,0:16:55.28,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,{\i0}Who{\i1} is in love? With {\i0}whom?{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.17,0:16:58.88,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,This makes the least sense of all!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.56,0:17:08.54,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Whatever the case,\Nwe agree on our betrothal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:11.15,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,The engagement ceremony \Nwill be in three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.15,0:17:13.02,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I'll arrange for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.02,0:17:14.99,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry about a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:17.05,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Of course. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.33,0:17:20.23,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I hope you will enjoy your \Nlife here in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.23,0:17:21.80,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,P-Pardon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.80,0:17:24.31,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Just once, I would like to go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.31,0:17:26.39,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,To the Shaderan house? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.39,0:17:30.15,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,My father didn't think that the \Nbetrothal would come to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:33.67,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I was to serve as your \Ncomfort for one night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.67,0:17:35.79,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,After forming a bond with you,\N he was insistent that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:37.29,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I be kicked out and return to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.29,0:17:39.92,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.92,0:17:44.91,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I never imagined this turn of events either, \Nso I must return home to receive instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.41,0:17:48.24,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.24,0:17:48.89,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.89,0:17:51.38,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie, if you would wait just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.63,0:18:00.05,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,H-Have I done something \Ndisrespectful toward them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:02.56,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,No, all I've been is disrespectful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.14,0:18:09.35,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I am afraid to say, Lady Marie,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.77,0:18:13.11,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,that you are forbidden to return \Nto your parents' house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.44,0:18:14.91,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.91,0:18:17.08,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The master's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:19.83,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Should Lord or Lady Shaderan come to visit,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:23.34,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,we ask that you receive the master's \Npermission before meeting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:31.50,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie, may I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:37.00,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Why are you under the impression \Nthat you are ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.61,0:18:42.01,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,B-Because my mother and father...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:45.60,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,My hair is covered in balls \Nof lint. I have freckles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:48.27,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,They always showed me my tattered, \Nraggedy self in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.96,0:18:58.06,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,If you'll permit me to say, Lady Marie,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.50,0:19:01.98,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,of those things you just mentioned, \Nthe only thing here is the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.98,0:19:04.29,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Please, look into it as much as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.24,0:19:09.23,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Look into the mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.74,0:19:12.70,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,And what will happen if I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:22.52,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,After all, the real me isn't this \Nperson I've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.42,0:19:30.65,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It doesn't feel real at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:34.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.40,0:19:38.44,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's so fluffy and warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.21,0:19:42.86,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It's like the world in a fairytale.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.61,0:19:46.84,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,A magnificent, white-walled palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.84,0:19:49.14,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Beautiful, glittering clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.14,0:19:51.21,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Wonderful lady attendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:55.28,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,879)}And... a count with beautiful green eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.39,0:19:57.96,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,It really is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.38,0:19:59.91,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.43,0:20:09.80,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.56,0:20:13.43,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I'm certain that when I wake, \Nthe spell will be broken,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.43,0:20:15.73,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,and all that will be left \Nis me in my tatters.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.47,0:20:20.40,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,{\fad(122,265)}I love you, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.89,0:20:29.26,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm so embarrassed! Having a \Ndream like this is just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:36.78,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But if it is a dream,\NI don't want to wake up yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.73,0:20:38.75,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.64,0:20:43.72,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,If this is a dream, then it's \Nall right for me to feel happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.37,0:21:04.14,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I had such a strange dream last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.14,0:21:09.33,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Now, I have to light the fire in the stove, \Nwake everyone in the family, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.33,0:21:10.20,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.52,0:21:20.18,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh. I'm still dreaming, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.18,0:21:22.72,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Then it wouldn't hurt\Nto enjoy this a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.04,0:21:27.15,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.15,0:21:28.64,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.31,0:21:31.10,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, I'm awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.67,0:21:33.20,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Please pardon the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.11,0:21:40.12,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Good morning, Lady Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.12,0:21:41.35,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,G-G...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.71,0:21:43.09,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.09,0:21:45.35,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Lady Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.02,0:21:50.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Y-You were kind enough to bow so politely \Nto me that I had to bow even lower.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.24,0:21:55.45,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Why? Please, be at your ease here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.33,0:22:01.55,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Um, who are these ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.00,0:22:05.93,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie, you have officially \Nbecome the master's fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.93,0:22:10.44,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,From now on, we three will \Nlook after your daily needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.44,0:22:11.55,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.13,0:22:16.85,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,They are Hannah and Ilza.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.00,0:22:20.13,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,My name is Ilza.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.13,0:22:21.98,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,My name is Hannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.34,0:24:01.18,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Oh, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.67,0:24:04.44,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Why won't you believe my feelings for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.13,0:24:09.26,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,True, it's my fault for getting you and \Nyour sister's names mixed up, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.17,0:24:12.64,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,If there's anything you \Nlack, I'll give it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.24,0:24:16.90,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,So, please... open your heart \Nto me, just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.60,0:24:22.02,Default Top,Kyros,0,0,0,,Next time, "A Life I Saw in a \NDream, and a Dream-like Life."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.93,0:24:27.01,sign_34980_302_Episode_3__A_Lif,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,1)\pos(404,320)\4c&H8F8C8B&\3c&H383838&}Episode 3 "A Life I Saw in a Dream, and a Dream-like Life"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.65,0:24:24.02,Default Top,Kyros,0,0,0,,Please, you must come and watch!
